Package: MetaNetAssoc
Type: Package
Title: Metabolite to Biological Term Association through MPI and PPI Networks
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("MetaNetAssoc", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org")
Author: MetaNetAssoc Team [aut, cre]
Maintainer: MetaNetAssoc Team <maintainer@example.org>
Description: Connects candidate metabolites to enriched biological terms through
    metabolite-protein interaction (MPI) and protein-protein interaction (PPI)
    networks. The package preserves auditable metabolite-gene-gene-term paths,
    reports raw and normalized association scores, supports optional hub-aware
    weighting, and provides quality-control summaries and visualizations. Version
    0.4.0 includes packaged human and mouse MPI reference networks, robust
    STRING retrieval, diagnostic MPI matching, and the DEG, HMDB, STRING, and
    clusterProfiler workflow with auditable result tables.
